description:
Design a 3-to-8 decoder that converts a 3-bit binary input (A) into a corresponding 7-segment display output (SEG). Each combination of the input will enable a specific pattern on the 7-segment display, allowing it to represent the values from 0 to 7. If the input does not match any of the defined cases, the output defaults to all segments turned off.
